      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Work back and front panels, each 146 sts wide and 81.7 cm tall. Shape the front neck with "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "dc2tog-g69"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "dc2tog"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". Work sleeves for 63.3 cm."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Assembly"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Seam shoulders. For each side, begin the seam at the underarm and sew down to 15 cm above the hem. Leave the lower 15 cm open as a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "side-vent-g69"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "side vent"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". Work dc edging along each open vent edge."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Sleeves"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Set sleeves as normal. Weave in all ends."
